तासां ब्रह्म महद्योनिरहं बीजप्रद: पिता ॥ ४ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3846,\"bb\":3386,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/4/b3386/\",\"body_value\":\"sarva-yoniṣu kaunteya
